(7692137, 1260377, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m really wanting to like this. It has so much potential, but something is just off. I''m thinking it''s the light sky? It''s rather spooky , the fact that the dog is wearing a spike collar makes him even spookier, but I can''t place what would make it better. Square crop? 6, but it seems like it could have been an 8</td>', 'I''m really wanting to like this. It has so much potential, but something is just off. I''m thinking it''s the light sky? It''s rather spooky , the fact that the dog is wearing a spike collar makes him even spookier, but I can''t place what would make it better. Square crop? 6, but it seems like it could have been an 8', '2021-04-20 10:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7692187, 1260484, 173844, '<td valign="top">(Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.)<br/>Absolutely enchanting scene.  The watercolor softness and subtlety impart a timelessness so sweet within which to linger.  The hints of color in the mountains and skies scintillate.  Exquisitely inky.</td>', '(Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.)Absolutely enchanting scene.  The watercolor softness and subtlety impart a timelessness so sweet within which to linger.  The hints of color in the mountains and skies scintillate.  Exquisitely inky.', '2021-04-20 22:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7692188, 1260519, 173844, '<td valign="top">(Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.)<br/>Absolutely beautiful colors, sublimely arrayed.  Not only the saturated blues, but also the tan, light brown beach or shoal, and that runny egg yolk.  All the more poignant because it''s a view of this very world.</td>', '(Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.)Absolutely beautiful colors, sublimely arrayed.  Not only the saturated blues, but also the tan, light brown beach or shoal, and that runny egg yolk.  All the more poignant because it''s a view of this very world.', '2021-04-20 22:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7692189, 1260626, 173844, '<td valign="top">(Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.)<br/>This type of image moves me with the ordinary dearness of the world.</td>', '(Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.)This type of image moves me with the ordinary dearness of the world.', '2021-04-20 22:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7692191, 1260631, 173844, '<td valign="top">(Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.)<br/>This goes to show that the possibilities of beauty are infinite.  So cleanly formulated and, in its own depths of expressiveness, simple.  This underwater confection is then topped with the cherry of its own reflection upon the under-surface of the water.   The red and blue work wonderfully together.  Her hands alone could carry the entire image.</td>', '(Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.)This goes to show that the possibilities of beauty are infinite.  So cleanly formulated and, in its own depths of expressiveness, simple.  This underwater confection is then topped with the cherry of its own reflection upon the under-surface of the water.   The red and blue work wonderfully together.  Her hands alone could carry the entire image.', '2021-04-20 23:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7692197, 1260698, 173844, '<td valign="top">(Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.)                                                           <br/>There''s a curious intimacy to this sparse graveyard.  The toning sets the overall mood.  The looming sky creates a sense of shelter, as do the structure''s walls, a metaphysical windbreak.  Yet it''s gloriously out in the open as well, drinking in the light.  Kind of breathtaking.</td>', '(Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.)                                                           There''s a curious intimacy to this sparse graveyard.  The toning sets the overall mood.  The looming sky creates a sense of shelter, as do the structure''s walls, a metaphysical windbreak.  Yet it''s gloriously out in the open as well, drinking in the light.  Kind of breathtaking.', '2021-04-20 23:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
