(7692208, 1260424, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> (Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.) <br/>The stunning unhappiness of this child is almost unbearable.  We can only pray that it''s not all like this, and there''s a plenitude of light as well in his life.  I don''t know how to say anything more.<br/>No doubt a terrific photograph. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Rich always has a wonderful way of expressing what i can find difficult to put into words  .. <br/>the not rating this challenge .. i felt exactly the same .. <br/>and about the child too .. <br/> <br/>this is one photo i wont forget in a long time .. <br/>to even have the confidence to take such a photo .. of someone suffering .. <br/>that is what often distinguishes a good photographer from a great photographer .. <br/>going where angels fear to tread almost .. <br/> <br/>many congratulations on such a raw image .. and of course the blue ribbon .. :)<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: (Haven''t rated entries in this challenge because I''m unsure what I should be looking for.  However, I''d like to express appreciation for the images that, in and of themselves, I enjoy.) The stunning unhappiness of this child is almost unbearable.  We can only pray that it''s not all like this, and there''s a plenitude of light as well in his life.  I don''t know how to say anything more.No doubt a terrific photograph.   Rich always has a wonderful way of expressing what i can find difficult to put into words  .. the not rating this challenge .. i felt exactly the same .. and about the child too ..  this is one photo i wont forget in a long time .. to even have the confidence to take such a photo .. of someone suffering .. that is what often distinguishes a good photographer from a great photographer .. going where angels fear to tread almost ..  many congratulations on such a raw image .. and of course the blue ribbon .. :)', '2021-04-21 02:41:23.000000', NULL, 0),
