(7692217, 1260470, 122128, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> many congratulations on a beautiful image .. and fourth place .. <br/>and second in line on your profile page .. :)<br/>i''m interested in your camera settings and the resulting grain/noise .. was that intentional to have such a fast shutter speed and high iso .. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I shoot this with my SONY A7RiV and not my old A7Rii, in this camera the grain is more noticeable in high ISO all other param was due to this lens limitation not fast lens so I pick F-7.1 , I almost always work with aperture priority so the ISO and shutter speed the camera pick for me .<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-04-21 10:47:35.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by roz: many congratulations on a beautiful image .. and fourth place .. and second in line on your profile page .. :)i''m interested in your camera settings and the resulting grain/noise .. was that intentional to have such a fast shutter speed and high iso .. :)   I shoot this with my SONY A7RiV and not my old A7Rii, in this camera the grain is more noticeable in high ISO all other param was due to this lens limitation not fast lens so I pick F-7.1 , I almost always work with aperture priority so the ISO and shutter speed the camera pick for me .', '2021-04-21 03:23:32.000000', '2021-04-21 11:47:35.000000', 0),
